0	section	The Mad Scientist
1	line	Professor Oddenstein	Be careful in here, there's lots of dangerous equipment.
1	option	I'm looking for a guy called Ernest.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a guy called Ernest.
2	line	Professor Oddenstein	Ah Ernest, top notch bloke. He's helping me with my experiments.
2	line	Player	So you know where he is then?
2	line	Professor Oddenstein	He's that chicken over there.
2	line	Player	Ernest is a chicken...? Are you sure?
2	line	Professor Oddenstein	Oh, he isn't normally a chicken, or at least he wasn't until he helped me test my pouletmorph machine.
2	line	Professor Oddenstein	It was originally going to be called a transmutation machine. But after testing pouletmorph seems more appropriate.
2	option	I'm glad Veronica didn't actually get engaged to a chicken.
3	line	Player	I'm glad Veronica didn't actually get engaged to a chicken.
3	line	Professor Oddenstein	Who's Veronica?
3	line	Player	Ernest's fiancee. She probably doesn't want to marry a chicken.
3	line	Professor Oddenstein	Ooh I dunno. She could have free eggs for breakfast.
3	line	Player	I think you'd better change him back.
3	line	Professor Oddenstein	Umm... It's not so easy...
3	line	Professor Oddenstein	My machine is broken, and the house gremlins have run off with some vital bits.
3	line	Player	Well I can look for them.
3	line	Professor Oddenstein	That would be a help. They'll be somewhere in the manor house or its grounds, the gremlins never get further than the entrance gate.
3	line	Professor Oddenstein	I'm missing the pressure gauge and a rubber tube. They've also taken my oil can, which I'm going to need to get this thing started again.
3	action	end
2	option	Change him back this instant!
